# ----- Personal / academic artifacts (kept locally, not pushed) -----
# Excludes papers, theses, certificates, posters, presentations etc. at the
# top of the repo. Anything under docs/ is still tracked, so you can publish
# a clean architecture diagram or write-up there.
/*.pdf
/*.docx
/*.pptx
/*.tex
/*.drawio
/*.xml
/*.mp4
/*.make
/*.tmp
